  "solution": "Given equation: 133 + 49 – 16 ÷ 2 × 34 = 356.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\n**Option 1) + and –**\n\nGiven: 133 + 49 – 16 ÷ 2 × 34 = 356\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 133 - 49 + __**16 ÷ 2**__ × 34 = 356\n\n⇒ 133 - 49 + __8____** × 34**__ = 356\n\n⇒ __**133**__ - 49 __**+ **__**__272__** = 356\n\n⇒ __405 - 49__ = 356\n\n⇒ **356 = 356**\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) – and ÷\n\nGiven: 133 + 49 ÷ 16 ÷ 2 × 34 = 356\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 133 + __**49 **____**÷**____** 16**__ - 2 × 34 = 356\n\n⇒ 133 + 3.06 - __**2 × 34**__ = 356\n\n⇒ __**133 + 3.06**__ - 68 = 356\n\n⇒ __1____36.06 - 68__ = 356\n\n⇒ 68.06 ≠ 356\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) × and +\n\nGiven: 133 × 49 – __**16 ÷ 2**__ + 34 = 356\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**133 × 49**__ – 8 + 34 = 356\n\n⇒ __**6517**__ - 8 __**+ 34**__ = 356\n\n⇒ __6551__ - 8 = 356\n\n⇒ 6543 ≠ 356\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷ and ×\n\nGiven: 133 + 49 – 16 ÷ 2 × 34 = 356\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 133 + 49 – 16 × __**2 **____**÷**____** 34**__ = 356\n\n⇒ 133 + 49 – __**16 **____**× 0.06**__ = 356\n\n⇒ __133 + 49__ - 0.96 = 356\n\n⇒ __182 - 0.96__ = 356\n\n⇒ 181.04 ≠ 12\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 1\".",
